      <p class="oj-note">
         <a id="ntr2-L_2014065EN.01002701-E0002" href="#ntc2-L_2014065EN.01002701-E0002">(<span class="oj-super">2</span>)</a>  Commission Regulation (EU) No 601/2012 of 21 June 2012 on the monitoring and reporting of greenhouse gas emissions pursuant to Directive 2003/87/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council (<a href="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/oj/JOL_2012_181_R_TOC">OJ L 181, 12.7.2012, p. 30</a>).</p>
      <p class="oj-note">
